; Handwritten DXF: z/elevation/thickness stay in file coordinates even after XY reflection; lexical forms must survive roundtrip.
D = DXF file=input.dxf
? count D -> ARC 1; CIRCLE 1; LINE 1; LWPOLYLINE 1
? unhandled D -> none
? entity D C1 -> LINE start=3,4 end=8,-2 start-z=1.25 end-z=-2.5 thickness=-0.75 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D C2 -> CIRCLE center=-5,6 radius=3 z=4.5 thickness=0.25 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D C3 -> ARC center=-2,3 radius=4 start-angle=330 end-angle=30 z=-6.25 thickness=2.5 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D C4 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=no vertex=-2,1 bulge=-0.5 vertex=-6,1 elevation=3.25 thickness=-1.5 extrusion=0,0,-1
? roundtrip D -> identical
